 e Opener Discovery Breakfast .\n\nEye Opener Discovery Breakfast\n\nThursd
 ay | September 24\n\n7:30 AM\n\nUF Hilton | Century Ballroom\n\nJoin us fo
 r an exciting special Eye Opener Discovery Breakfast with the 14th preside
 nt of the University of Florida\, Dr. Stuart R. Bell. In our community con
 versation\, the president will share his vision and discuss the current st
 ate of our campus. His extensive leadership experience and enthusiasm are 
 sure to energize both our campus and the city! Dr. Bell took office on Jul
 y 1\, 2026 and brings with him a wealth of leadership experience and excit
 ement to UF and Gainesville. Space is limited\, so we encourage you to reg
 ister early.\nHosted by: Karen Thomas\, UF Community Relations\nstartGNV: 
 https://startgnv.com/event/september-eye-opener-discovery-breakfast/
