BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f3041a7512b43b4d@ignite-gnv-events
DTSTAMP:20261001T174646Z
SUMMARY:The Florida Way Forward
DTSTART:20261021T180000Z
DTEND:20261021T193000Z
LOCATION:University of Florida\, 655 Reitz Union Drive\, Gainesville\, FL 3
 2603
URL:https://calendar.ufl.edu/innovate/event/57608-the-florida-way-forward
DESCRIPTION:Standing InnOvation is UF Innovate | Tech Licensing’s annual 
 celebration recognizing University of Florida researchers who have disclos
 ed\, optioned\, or licensed technologies or received issued patents during
  FY26. This is an invite-only event that honors the outstanding contributi
 ons of UF innovators across disciplines.\nWhile Standing InnOvation is inv
 ite-only\, the keynote is free and open to the public. The program begins 
 with a keynote from Patric Young\, former Florida Gator standout\, profess
 ional basketball player\, and current ESPN SEC Network analyst.\nThrough h
 is story of resilience and perseverance\, he demonstrates how setbacks can
  create opportunities for growth and how progress is not always linear. Hi
 s journey reflects what it means to embrace the Florida Way Forward and ke
 ep moving ahead\, no matter the challenge.Click here to register for the k
 eynote session. (https://luma.com/m00jg6q6)\nAbout the speaker: Patric You
 ng\nPatric Young is a former Florida Gator basketball player\, professiona
 l basketball player\, ESPN SEC Network analyst\, author\, motivational spe
 aker\, and founder of the Patric Young Foundation (https://www.py4foundati
 on.org/). Patric played for the Florida Gators from 2010 to 2014 before be
 ginning his professional basketball career.\nAfter an accident left him pa
 ralyzed from the waist down\, he began a new chapter focused on resilience
 \, perseverance\, and purpose. Today\, Patric shares his story through spe
 aking\, writing\, and his work with the Patric Young Foundation. His exper
 ience shows that setbacks can change your path without defining your futur
 e.\nHosted by: UF Innovate\nstartGNV: https://startgnv.com/event/the-flori
 da-way-forward/\nUF Innovate: https://calendar.ufl.edu/innovate/event/5760
 8-the-florida-way-forward
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8baccdee1854f66b@ignite-gnv-events
DTSTAMP:20261001T174646Z
SUMMARY:Project "Show & Tell" Evening
DTSTART:20261021T210000Z
DTEND:20261021T220000Z
LOCATION:https://us06web.zoom.us/j/82993071959?pwd=nktfFGgoUMduLMvBiwwkkzuR
 CUJyZM.1
URL:https://gnv.ai/events/project-show-and-tell-evening
DESCRIPTION:Come on by to share what you've been working on\, get feedback 
 and support... And celebrate others :)\n\nJoin GNV.ai on the third Wednesd
 ay of each month from 5PM to 6pmPM for an evening of community\, creativit
 y\, and collaboration. This public event highlights projects built by loca
 l innovators using AI for art\, business\, and everyday problem-solving. C
 ome share your work\, get inspired by others\, and connect with like-minde
 d creators shaping the future of AI in Gainesville.\n\nWhoever is on the c
 all by 5:05pm gets a slot to present.\nHosted by: aiGNV / GNV.AI\naiGNV / 
 GNV.AI: https://gnv.ai/events/project-show-and-tell-evening
END:VEVENT
