 st Saturday of each month from 11:30 AM to 3:00 PM for a free\, hands-on w
 orkshop exploring how to use "low-code" AI for creativity\, productivity\,
  and everyday life. Open to the public and designed for low-intermediate e
 xperience levels\, these sessions will help you learn practical tools and 
 techniques for using AI to spark ideas\, automate tasks\, and simplify you
